   "evidence": "`upstream/mathlib/Mathlib/Topology/Algebra/GroupWithZero.lean:189`: `theorem Filter.Tendsto.div ... : Tendsto (f / g) l (\ud835\udcdd (a / b))` \u2014 Pi-valued, hence the repeated `Pi.div_def` unfolding; grep shows the same `simpa only [Pi.div_def, div_one] using` line at 231, 239, 256.",
