   "fix": "Add one private helper near the top of the section, e.g. `private theorem tendsto_div_one {f g : \u211d \u2192 \u211d} {l : Filter \u211d} (hf : Tendsto f l (\ud835\udcdd 1)) (hg : Tendsto g l (\ud835\udcdd 1)) : Tendsto (fun \u03bd => f \u03bd / g \u03bd) l (\ud835\udcdd 1) := by simpa only [Pi.div_def, div_one] using hf.div hg one_ne_zero`, and use it at all three sites.",
